# Supabase

## Clients
- Browser: `@/lib/supabase/client`
- Server: `@/lib/supabase/server` (SSR/cookies pattern)

## Migrations
- New schema → `supabase/migrations/` numbered SQL
- Seed data → `supabase/seed.sql`
- Future: `claim_registry` for approved marketing claims

## Security
- RLS required before production data
- No service role keys in client code
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` only on client
